<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher on Friday.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 586.72, up 3.25.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose seven cents.</p>
<p>Advances beat declines 283 to 235.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 21,029,530 compared with 28,388,795 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1881))</p>
